  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "✨Introducing ~ Beach, Please<br>Private Heated Pool | Fire Pit | Moke | 6 Bikes | Easy Beach Access <br><br>Beach, please—it's vacation time! 🏖️ This newly remodeled 5-bedroom, 6.5-bath retreat sleeps up to 14 and delivers luxury at every turn. Enjoy brand-new Viking appliances, a heated pool, fire pit, games, and a grill in your private outdoor oasis. Cruise 30A in your custom Moke, chill on the balcony with ocean views, or hop on the complimentary custom heron bikes. <br>Read on for more →<br><br>Fall in love with ~ <br>▶ Luxury touches & updated features <br>- New interior and exterior copper light fixtures <br>- Expanded deck, new lighting, and exposed copper exterior shower <br>- Brand-new Pottery Barn furniture on decks and interior <br>- Added custom built-in bunk room with entertainment area, great for kids! <br>- All bathrooms remodeled with new decor, finishes, and lighting <br>- Viking kitchen appliances, remodeled kitchen, and cold bar mini fridge<br><br>▶Outdoor Oasis<br>- Heated Pool <br>- Fire Pit <br>- New Grill <br>- Lounge and dining seating <br>- Upper-level decks feature cozy sectionals, daybed swings, and ocean views<br><br>▶ Fire pit and fireplace<br><br>▶ 6 Adult bikes <br><br>▶ Private heated pool <br><br>▶ 5 - Seater Moke <br><br>▶ Peloton (in Primary bedroom)<br><br>▶ All 5 bedrooms have ensuite bathrooms <br><br>It's a beautiful day in the neighborhood...Welcome to Seagrove ~<br>- Around the corner from local favorites, Cafe ThirtyA and The Perfect Pig. Must check out: Old Florida Fish House (come at twilight hour for the best ambiance!) and Seagrove Village Market.<br>- Beachy Bean will be your new favorite go-to coffee and lunch spot! <br>- 2-3 minute walk to Walton Dunes Beach Access <br>- 10 mins to Seaside. Shopping, dining, and rows of food trucks. Perfect break from the beach! <br>- 10 minutes to Rosemary and Alys Beach<br><br>✨Step inside ~ <br>FIRST FLOOR<br>- As you enter the house, the first room you will be greeted to is the laundry room that connects to the first-floor shared bathroom. The laundry room is equipped with 2 full-sized Samsung washers and dryers. <br>- Consider this your pool room! The first-floor bathroom features a walk-in shower and the door that leads to the backyard oasis.<br>- The outdoor oasis will take your vacation to a new level. The patio features an outdoor shower, towel racks, brand-new gas grill (with gas line), Frontgate outdoor dining that seats 6 with shade, outdoor Connect 4, and firewood for the fire pit. Step off the patio onto the private pool deck with Frontgate loungers to soak up the sun or gather around the outdoor fire pit for fun nights with your crew! <br>- Step back inside to the first-floor king bedroom, featuring an ensuite with a walk-in shower. <br>- Further down the hall is a brand-new custom bunk room. Featured here are 2 Twin over Queen bunk beds, 2 oversized Lovesac bean bag chairs, and an awesome entertainment area! Think: oversized Smart TV for movie nights in, a touch of nostalgia with a large basket of beanie babies, and fun decor and stuffies to keep the kiddos happy! This room also features an ensuite with dual sinks and a walk-in shower. This is the sweet life! <br><br>SECOND FLOOR<br>- Just up the stairs, you'll find open concept living at its best! <br>- The high-end kitchen is fully equipped for the top chef in your family! This culinary oasis features high-end Viking appliances, Schott Zwiesel stemware, a pot filler, a beverage cooler, and a prep sink. Get in on the action or sit back and relax at the island that seats 4.<br>- Just behind the kitchen is an oversized half bath. <br>- As you continue through the space, you'll see a dining area for 8 with cozy chairs and great views. <br>- The living room was designed with modern luxury in mind. Enjoy movie nights in with the electric fireplace, a cozy and plush couch, plus oversized lounge chairs. <br>- Step out onto the balcony and soak up the sun with the outdoor seating or the daybed. This space also allows you to enjoy meals in the salty air with the outdoor dining table that seats 4.<br><br>THIRD FLOOR<br>- Head upstairs to the top level of your luxury oasis! <br>- The primary king suite invites you to unwind in serene, modern luxury. Start your morning with a ride on the Peloton, then step onto your private balcony to enjoy fresh air from the outdoor seating or lounge on the daybed. The en suite bath feels like your own personal spa, complete with a dual walk-in shower, double vanities, and a spacious walk-in closet<br>- Next to the primary bedroom is the third-floor King bedroom, which features a private balcony and an ensuite with a shower/tub combo.<br>- Further down the hall is your fifth bedroom, a queen room featuring an ensuite with a walk-in shower.<br><br>🛏️For Rest ~<br>- Floor 1: King bedroom with ensuite<br>- Floor 1: Two Twin over Queen (sleeps 6) bunkbed room with ensuite<br>- Floor 3: Primary king bedroom with ensuite <br>- Floor 3: Queen bedroom with ensuite<br>- Floor 3: Queen bedroom with ensuite<br><br>✓ The Essentials ~ All included in your stay<br>- We provide a starter kit of everything you'll need to kick off your stay: paper towels, toilet paper, dish soap, laundry pods, and more.<br>- Kitchen essentials like olive oil, salt and pepper, and basic cooking staples provided <br>- The home has both a Keurig, an espresso machine, and a standard drip coffee maker! Bonus: coffee's on us!<br>- Premium full-size bath products in every bathroom/kitchen – We provide body wash, shampoo, conditioner, lotion, and hand soap.<br>- Traveling with little ones? We've thoughtfully provided a highchair, Pack 'n Play, and built-in baby gates.<br>- Beach Gear: We've got you covered - towels, 10 chairs, 2 umbrellas, a wagon, beach toys, large Yeti 65 cooler, and small soft Yeti cooler.<br>- 2 Full size Samsung washers and dryers<br><br>✏️Other things to note:<br>- The driveway can fit up to 4 vehicles.<br>- The word is out! 30A is one of Florida's best vacation spots. Unfortunately, more visitors means less parking options. Additional parking spaces are the responsibility of the renter. We recommend looking into nearby storage facilities that offer long-term parking options in their lots. <br>- The pool can be heated for $50/day.<br>- Minimum age to rent the home is 25.<br>- Vacation disruptions can be a bummer. While it doesn't happen often, you may experience issues with Wi-Fi or construction on 30A. We are not responsible for any disruptions to the Wi-Fi service or any construction that may affect your experience. Please note that such occurrences are beyond our control, and we appreciate your understanding and patience in these matters.<br><br>This home is proudly managed by Kalos Dwellings. Please reach out if we can answer any questions for you! 💛",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
